{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t黃大仙上邨下午3時起緊急停水，預計凌晨3時恢復供水。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n警方表示，下午2時許接報，黃大仙道近馬仔坑道有水管爆裂，黃大仙上邨停水，署方安排臨時食水供應的水車及水缸，分別位於黃大仙上邨倡善樓、達善樓和啟善樓。至下午5時半左右，有約200人到場排隊等候取水。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：汪溟曦\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:21:45.993344+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T10:05:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T13:38:48.081236+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:18:35.184536+00:00","content_hash":"fb89091109531e8dbd72f19ccf40cc43b0a0d25a413086f4647ffefaff055cb8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}